# Trivy Ignore List
# 
# This file contains CVEs that are explicitly ignored during scanning.
# Format: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN [expiration-date] [reason]
# Example: CVE-2024-12345 2024-12-31 False positive - not using vulnerable code path
#
# Keep this file minimal and document all exceptions with:
# 1. CVE ID
# 2. Expiration date (when to re-evaluate)
# 3. Clear justification for ignoring
#
# CVE-2023-99999 2024-06-30 Example ignored CVE - remove this line

